  "description": "This bundle includes high-quality PNG files perfect for sublimation. With this bundle, you’ll be able to create beautiful Halloween-themed products that will sell like hotcakes!\nBenefits:\n-Easy to use: simply download the file and upload it to your cutting machine software\n-Compatible with a variety of machines, including Cricut and Silhouette\n– Great for personalized\n– Affordable and easy to use\n-Available in :\n✔ 15 SVG files\n✔ 15 PNG files\n✔ 15 EPS files\n✔ 15 DXF files\n✔ Quality work, 100% vector file\n✔ Every Vector Resizable | 300 DPI Resolution\n✔ Easy to color change | Easy to resize\n**These designs can be used for many purposes such as but not limited to monogram making, logo design, t-shirt design, sign making, card making, scrapbooking, vinyl decals, and many more…",
